        "# Customer Churn Prediction: A Classification Project\n",
        "\n",
        "**Goal:** Predict whether a customer will leave (churn) based on their behavior\n",
        "\n",
        "**Dataset:** Telco Customer Churn (7,043 customers, 21 features)\n",
        "\n",
        "**Business Value:** Identify at-risk customers early so company can retain them\n",
        "\n",
        "**Why this matters:** Classification problems are very common in industry (spam detection, fraud, churn, etc.)"
      ]
    },
